<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79688" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παροικ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dwell beside</i>, c. acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ
				Κνίδου μέχρι Σινώπης τὴν Ἀσίαν π</span>. <i>dwell
				along the coasts of</i> Asia, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				4.162
			</span></i> : c. dat., <i>live near</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.71
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς πυραμίσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					666.13
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>; <i>dwell among</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τισι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.93
			</span></i> : abs., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.82
			</span></i> ; of places, <i>lie near</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Vect.</u>
				1.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>live in</i> a place <i>as</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάροικος, οἱ παροικοῦντες ξένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					13.47
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				709.9
			</span></i> (Chersonesus, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ἐπὶ ξένης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.416
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>sojourn in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἱερουσαλήμ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					24.18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἀνθ ρώπινον βίον παρῳκηκότες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Mort.</u>
					38
				</span></i>
			.</div>
